        "heading_3UKcnJ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Re[Sens] was born as a brand that works with sensitive skin not by “shutting it down,” but through understanding and respecting its reactions."
          }
        },
        "richtext_8FNd3H": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Sensi-cosmetology is a modern skincare approach based on knowledge of receptors, sensory neurotransmission, the microbiome, and barrier function.</p><p>The formulas are designed <strong>not to suppress reactivity but to gently recalibrate it:</strong> reducing sensitivity without losing sensory responsiveness.</p><p>Sensitivity, both physical and emotional, is shaped by many factors. At the center lies the concept of <strong>inflammaging</strong> — chronic, subclinical inflammation that gradually alters skin structure, lowers tolerance, and accelerates aging.</p>",
            "text_size": 16
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_3UKcnJ",
        "richtext_8FNd3H"
      ],
