        "title": "The A-REDENSITY line",
        "text": "<p>is based on microbiome-friendly care principles that support the balance and diversity of the epidermal microbiome. Its key component is a concentrate of <em><strong>Lactobacillus casei</strong></em>(1×10¹² cells per gram), which helps restore the population of commensal staphylococci (Coagulase-negative staphylococci — CoNS).</p>",
